      "hizbQuarter": 94,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1602,
      "text": "Thus your Lord will choose you and teach you the interpretation of dreams, and He will complete His favor upon you and upon the house of Jacob, just as He completed it upon your forefathers Abraham and Isaac before. Indeed, your Lord is All-Knowing, All-Wise.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 236,
      "ruku": 193,
      "hizbQuarter": 94,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1603,
      "text": "In the story of Joseph and his brothers there are lessons for those who seek [them].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 236,
      "ruku": 194,
      "hizbQuarter": 95,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1604,
      "text": "When they said, “Joseph and his brother[3] are dearer to our father than we are, although we are a group of so many. Indeed, our father is clearly mistaken.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 236,
      "ruku": 194,
      "hizbQuarter": 95,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1605,
      "text": "Kill Joseph or cast him out to another land, so that your father’s attention will only be to you; then you will become righteous people[4].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 236,
      "ruku": 194,
      "hizbQuarter": 95,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1606,
      "text": "One of them said, “Do not kill Joseph; but if you must do something, then throw him into the bottom of the well, so that some travelers may pick him up.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 236,
      "ruku": 194,
      "hizbQuarter": 95,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1607,
      "text": "They said, “O our father, why do you not trust us with Joseph[5], although we truly care for him?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 236,
      "ruku": 194,
      "hizbQuarter": 95,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1608,
      "text": "Send him with us tomorrow so that he may enjoy himself and play; we will surely keep him safe.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُوسُفَ",
        "englishName": "Yusuf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Joseph",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
